### 3. Restrictions
You must not use this repository to infringe intellectual property or privacy rights, to break paid
services or circumvent technical protection measures where prohibited by law, to attack or access
devices/networks without authorization, or in violation of applicable law.

### 4. No warranty
Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied. The authors are not liable for
any damages arising from its use. You bear all risk and must ensure you own or are authorized to
test the relevant hardware.

### 5. Trademarks
All product names and marks belong to their respective owners. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by LLVision.

### 6. No proprietary material
This repository contains **no** APK, firmware image, or third-party proprietary binary.
